{"id":"00237","root":"uni00237_1","name":{"ja":"エリカ・ブラックモア","en":"Erica Blackmore"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"エリカ・ブラックモア","en":"Erica Blackmore"},"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-09-12","limited":true,"characterId":176,"profile":{"ja":"東京キングダムに根城を持ち、金次第でどんな勢力にでも手を貸すフリーの傭兵。戦闘だけでなく潜入、調査、工作と何でも一人でこなせる腕利きで引く手数多の売れっ子である。彼女は海外の貧困地域に産まれたが、才能と頭脳、そして僅かな運によって身一つで這い上がった。そんな境遇からか金への執着はすさまじく、依頼主より少しでも多く金を積まれれば簡単に寝返る。……と見せかけて両方の味方のフリをし、どちらからも依頼料をせしめる、悪どくも要領の良い所がある。世界中を回り金儲けのできる場所を転々としているが、数か月前から情勢の混迷を予見して、東京キングダムに滞在している。普段は愛嬌もあり面倒見も良い、気のいいねえちゃんといった性格。自信に満ち溢れすぎているのが玉に瑕。美人と言うより愛らしい容姿を自覚しており、必要なら猫を被ってあざとく振る舞う。彼女を慕う傭兵仲間もおり、何かと理由をつけては金を毟られているが、なぜか彼らは嬉しそうである。","en":"Erica Blackmore is a freelance mercenary who keeps a base in Tokyo Kingdom and will lend her services to any faction for the right price. She is a highly skilled solo operative capable of handling combat, infiltration, investigation, and sabotage, making her a sought-after star. Born in an impoverished overseas region, she clawed her way up alone thanks to talent, intellect, and a sliver of luck. That background fuels an intense obsession with money; if a client offers even a little more than expected, she will readily switch sides. She also has a knack for pretending to support both sides and extracting fees from each, a cunning and efficient trait. Though she roams the world chasing profit, she foresaw the current turmoil months ago and has taken up residence in Tokyo Kingdom. Usually she's charming, caring, and a pleasant \"big sister\" type, but her over-confidence is her Achilles' heel. She knows she's more cute than beautiful and can act coy and manipulative when needed. A group of fellow mercenaries admires her, constantly finding excuses to squeeze money out of her—yet they seem oddly delighted to do so."},"illustrator":"ユージ","voiceActor":"梅原亜衣","forms":[{"id":"uni00237_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1036,2072],"sp":[170,1