0,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に極小威力で４回攻撃、高確率で暗闇状態にする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"Random enemies: 1 hits of 81% Science damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: 50% chance to inflict Darkness for 3 turns","icon":"darkness","tag":"ailment","ref":"ab:7"}]},"310003":{"slot":"ultimate","id":310003,"name":{"ja":"ツイン・サキュラーソー"},"hits":7,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に超特大威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":2,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に超特大威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":3,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に超特大威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":4,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に超特大威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":5,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に超特大威力で攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 720% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"強欲な傭兵"},"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ユニットのSPDを大アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"Science allies: SPD +20%","icon":"spd_up","tag":"passive"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":1,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00002",80],[1,"blo00006",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",10],[11,"blo00014",10],[12,"blo00002",160],[12,"blo00006",2],[13,"blo00007",10],[13,"blo00008",10],[14,"blo00010",10],[14,"blo00011",10],[15,"blo00013",10],[15,"blo00014",10],[16,"blo00007",10],[16,"blo00008",10],[17,"blo00010",10],[17,"blo00011",10],[18,"blo00013",10],[18,"blo00014",10],[19,"blo00007",10],[19,"blo00008",10],[20,"blo00010",5],[20,"blo00011",15],[20,"blo00012",5],[21,"blo00007",5],[21,"blo00008",15],[21,"blo00009",5],[22,"blo00013",5],[22,"blo00014",15],[22,"blo00015",5],[23,"blo00010",5],[23,"blo00011",15],[23,"blo00012",5],[24,"blo00007",5],[24,"blo00008",15],[24,"blo00009",5],[25,"blo00013",5],[25,"blo00014",15],[25,"blo00015",5],[26,"blo00002",80],[26,"blo00006",1],[27,"blo00008",3],[27,"blo00011",3],[27,"blo00014",3],[28,"blo00008",3],[28,"blo00011",3],[28,"blo00014",3],[29,"blo00008",3],[29,"blo00011",3],[29,"blo00014",3],[30,"blo00008",3],[30,"blo00011",3],[30,"blo00014",3],[31,"blo00002",160],[31,"blo00006",2],[32,"blo00008",3],[32,"blo00011",3],[32,"blo00014",3],[33,"blo00008",3],[33,"blo00011",3],[33,"blo00014",3],[34,"blo00008",3],[34,"blo00011",3],[34,"blo00014",3],[35,"blo00008",3],[35,"blo00011",3],[35,"blo00014",3],[36,"blo00002",160],[36,"blo00006",2],[37,"blo00008",3],[37,"blo00011",3],[37,"blo00014",3],[38,"blo00008",3],[38,"blo00011",3],[38,"blo00014",3],[39,"blo00008",3],[39,"blo00011",3],[39,"blo00014",3],[40,"blo00008",3],[40,"blo00011",3],[40,"blo00014",3],[41,"blo00002",160],[41,"blo00006",2],[42,"blo00008",3],[42,"blo00011",3],[42,"blo00014",3],[43,"blo00008",3],[43,"blo00011",3],[43,"blo00014",3],[44,"blo00008",3],[44,"blo00011",3],[44,"blo00014",3],[45,"blo00008",3],[45,"blo00011",3],[45,"blo00014",3],[46,"blo00002",160],[46,"blo00006",2],[47,"blo00008",3],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00011",3],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00014",3],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00008",3],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00011",3],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00014",3],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00008",3],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00011",3],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00014",3],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00008",3],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00011",3],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00014",3],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"エリカ・ブラックモアよ。お金さえ積んでくれれば、それに見合うだけの仕事をしてあげる","en":"I'm Erica Blackmore. As long as you load me up with cash, I'll do a job worthy of it."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"あら、私にご依頼？　たくさん払ってくれるなら、戦闘、潜入、調査、工作、なんでもするわよ","en":"Oh, you've got a request for me? If you pay a lot, I'll handle combat, infiltration, investigation, sabotage—anything."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"私はね、たくさんお金をくれる方の味方なの。ま、どっちも味方することもあるけどね","en":"I side with whoever gives me lots of money. Well, I might side with both sometimes, though."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"ここは君の奢りね。なあに？　こんな可愛いお姉さんがデートしてあげたのに、そんなはした金をケチるわけ？","en":"Consider this on the house. What's up? After this cute big sister dates you, you're going to be stingy with such a petty amount?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"ふふん。君からはお金の匂いがするわ。絞れるだけ絞れるまで傍にいようかしら♪","en":"Hehe. I can smell money on you. Shall I stick around until I squeeze every last drop?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"また後始末してないじゃない。もう、しょうがないわねぇ。私は、お金にならないことはしない主義なのよ？","en":"You didn't clean up after yourself again. Ugh, fine then. I don't do anything that doesn't make me money, you know?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"ええっ、私がこの隊のリーダー？　んもぅ、面倒なこと押し付けるんだから！　追加報酬はもらうからね！","en":"What? Me the leader of this squad? Ugh, you're dumping the hassle on me! I'll take the extra reward, okay!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"まあまあ上得意様！　今回も迅速に、ご依頼を遂行してみせましょう！　ややっ、多めの前金、毎度あり～！","en":"Alright, dear client! I'll carry out the request swiftly as always! Oh, a generous advance, thanks as always~!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00237_1/uni00237_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[100,200],"scenes":[["chr_0153_1_r18"],["chr_0153_2_r18"]],"stills":[["chr_0153_1a_r18"],["chr_0153_2a_r18"]],"obtain":[{"kind":"event","type":"Map event","title":{"ja":"Map event #8","en":"Map event #8"},"archive":true},{"kind":"mission","title":null}],"standardPool":false,"art":{"graphicId":"uni_00237","graphicNum":2,"r18GraphicId":"uni_00237_r18","r18GraphicNum":2,"spineId":"Chr_0153"}}